		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead, rotted giant bat that hunts for fresh flesh. Also called ghoul bats.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +2 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ghoul Fever</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, rise as ghoul at midnight.</p><p></p><p><strong>Screech</strong>. All non-bats within double near, CON 12+ or stunned 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
